              "text": "The specific combination of the substances contained in the cataplasm is widely acknowledged in the literature for its soothing properties. The essential oils contained are very active as soothing, relaxing, and detoxifying, while the botanical extracts are known for their beneficial properties. The wellbeing generated by the compress with this cataplasm comes from the protective and softening effect of the formulation, which nourishes deep tissues and gives a feeling of warmth and breathing comfort during seasonal changes.",
