              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "The experience gained since 1956 at the Phytotherapy Centre Zanellato is now available for everybody and everywhere, thanks to the shipping of the practical small patches that you can apply with ease at home.",
