            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "aqua, Linum usitatissimum L.powder, Brassica nigra L.powder, Cynnamomum camphora leaf oil, Methyl Salycilate, Lavandula hybrida grosso herb oil, Gaultheria procumbebs leaf oil, alcohol, Turpentine, Ficus carica fruit extract, Salix Alba Extract, Glycerin, Boswellia serrata extract, Persea gratissima oil, Menthol, phenoxyethanol, ethylexyglicerin, imidazolidinyl urea, Limonene, Linalcool, Eugenol, Benzyl alcohol, Geraniol.",
